      "material": "titanium",
      "category": "speeds_feeds",
      "tip_text": "Use low cutting speeds: SFM 100-200 for Ti-6Al-4V with carbide",
      "detail": "Titanium has very low thermal conductivity — heat concentrates at the cutting edge. Low speed is essential for tool life.",
