      "material": "titanium",
      "category": "speeds_feeds",
      "tip_text": "Maintain high feed per tooth to move heat into the chip",
      "detail": "Thick chips carry away more heat. Thin chips leave heat in the workpiece and tool. Target 0.004-0.006 in/tooth for milling.",
