      "material": "titanium",
      "category": "tooling",
      "tip_text": "Use carbide with PVD TiAlN coating — the standard for titanium milling",
      "detail": "PVD coatings maintain sharp edges. CVD coatings are too thick and round the edge, causing rubbing in titanium.",
